flowchart LR
    Source["Synthetic event source<br/>Document and operation identifiers"] --> Ingress["Receive event<br/>Validate the request"] --> Process["Process event<br/>Capture diagnostic context"]
    Process --> Decision{Succeeded?}
    Decision -->|Yes| Store[(Event store)]
    Decision -->|No| ErrorLog["Flow error log<br/>Operation, stage and diagnostic message"]
    Process -.->|Diagnostic context| ErrorLog
    ErrorLog --> Queue["Notification queue<br/>Synthetic recipients only"] --> Notify["Notify operator<br/>Review and investigate"]
    ErrorLog --> Review["Review console<br/>Search the synthetic incident record"]
    Store -.->|Reference| Review
    Retry --> Ingress
    Review --> Retry
    Notify --> Review
